        "description": "She is the crown princess of Meigis. While a knight-class man was abducting her, Al Wayne saved her, causing her to be infatuated with him.\n\nAs a crown princess, Fal is a dignified beauty who puts her citizens and beloved before her. She treats everyone with equality and compassion. Nevertheless, she is a qualified future queen for her wisdom. But, while being such a person, she is unusually stubborn and does not tolerate discrimination.",
